Tom: I''d love to see the Rio Carnival. The dancing and music look so exciting.
Lucy: It does look amazing, but it''s very far away and the weather is so hot.
Tom: Good point. What would you prefer then?
Lucy: I''d rather visit the Lantern Festival. I love guessing riddles and seeing the lights.
Tom: That sounds relaxing. And the floating lanterns on the river must be beautiful.
Lucy: Exactly. Let''s choose the Lantern Festival this time and save the carnival for later.
Tom: Agreed. I''ll start planning our trip tonight.', 'Lucy 和 Tom 商量春天去看哪个节日;Tom 想去里约狂欢节,觉得歌舞很刺激;但 Lucy 嫌太远又太热;她更想去元宵节,喜欢猜灯谜和看灯;Tom 觉得轻松,河上漂浮的灯笼一定很美;两人决定这次去元宵节,把狂欢节留到以后。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which festival does Tom first want to visit?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The Rio Carnival.","The Lantern Festival.","Thanksgiving.","The Naadam Festival."]},{"q":"Why does Lucy worry about that choice?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It is too cheap.","It is far away and the weather is hot.","No one dances there.","It is held in winter."]},{"q":"What does Lucy enjoy about the Lantern Festival?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Guessing riddles and seeing the lights.","Eating roast turkey.","Watching wrestling.","Lighting firecrackers."]},{"q":"What does Tom say about the river at the festival?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It is dangerous.","The floating lanterns must be beautiful.","It is too crowded.","It is far too noisy."]},{"q":"What do they finally decide?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["To stay at home.","To go to the carnival now.","To visit the Lantern Festival this time.","To skip both festivals."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U1');
Maria: Oh yes! It''s the most exciting day of my whole year.
Reporter: How long did it take to prepare your costume?
Maria: Months! My friends and I worked on it for nearly a year.
Reporter: That''s amazing. What''s your favourite part of the carnival?
Maria: Marching along the streets while everyone dances to the samba music.
Reporter: And how do you feel right now, in the middle of the crowd?
Maria: I feel free and full of joy. There''s nothing else like it!', '记者采访身穿亮丽服装的 Maria 是否享受狂欢节;Maria 说这是她一年中最激动的一天;服装准备了好几个月,和朋友们做了近一年;她最喜欢的是在桑巴音乐中沿街游行;此刻置身人群中,她感到自由、满心喜悦,觉得没有什么能与之相比。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is Maria wearing?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A bright carnival costume.","A plain school uniform.","A heavy winter coat.","A wrestling robe."]},{"q":"How long did it take to prepare her costume?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A single morning.","Nearly a year.","Only one week.","A few minutes."]},{"q":"What is Maria''s favourite part of the carnival?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Eating mooncakes.","Guessing riddles.","Marching along the streets to the samba music.","Watching fireworks alone."]},{"q":"How does Maria feel in the middle of the crowd?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Tired and bored.","Worried and afraid.","Cold and lonely.","Free and full of joy."]},{"q":"What does Maria say about this day?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It is the most exciting day of her year.","It is just an ordinary day.","It is too long and tiring.","It is her least favourite festival."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U1');
Max: Oh yes, it was Thanksgiving. I went home to celebrate with my family.
Song Lin: Wonderful! What did your mother cook?
Max: A big roast turkey, mashed potatoes, pumpkin pie and apple pie.
Song Lin: That sounds delicious. What did you do after dinner?
Max: We watched a sports game on TV and shared what we were grateful for.
Song Lin: And what was the best part of the festival for you?
Max: Honestly, just being together with everyone I love.', '宋林见 Max 很高兴,问他是否享受了节日;Max 说是感恩节,他回家和家人一起庆祝;母亲做了大烤火鸡、土豆泥、南瓜派和苹果派;饭后他们看电视体育比赛,并分享各自的感激之事;Max 说节日里最棒的部分就是和所爱的人在一起。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What festival did Max celebrate?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The Lantern Festival.","The Rio Carnival.","Thanksgiving.","Halloween."]},{"q":"What did Max''s mother cook?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only mooncakes.","Just rice and tea.","Nothing at all.","A roast turkey with potatoes and pies."]},{"q":"What did the family do after dinner?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["They watched a sports game and shared their thanks.","They went straight to sleep.","They left the house.","They lit firecrackers outside."]},{"q":"What was the best part of the festival for Max?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["The television show.","Being together with the people he loves.","The pumpkin pie.","The cold weather."]},{"q":"How does Max seem to feel about the festival?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Bored and tired.","Angry and upset.","Happy and grateful.","Worried and afraid."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U1');

